    {
      "id": "evt_gcal_com_verci_0d51e00c",
      "name": "Consumer Tech Founders Dinner by FirstMark, Verci, Orrick and Deel",
      "type": "technology",
      "locationId": "",
      "communityId": "com_verci",
      "description": "About this event\nVerci, FirstMark, Orrick and Deel are hosting a private, curated dinner for a select group of consumer tech founders, idea to series a building in nyc.\nMore about the hosts\nDeel is one platform for payroll, HR, benefits, mobility, performance, and device management across 150+ countries. Built on owned infrastructure, powered by AI, and supported by thousands of local experts, Deel helps businesses scale smarter, faster, and more compliantly.\nFirstMark is a venture capital firm based in New York City, partnering with founders to make their mark on the world.\nOrrick\u00a0is a global, tech-focused law firm built for the innovation economy. Team Orrick partners with entrepreneurs, investors, and market leaders to build, scale, and protect what\u2019s next, providing end-to-end legal and strategic guidance from financing and protecting IP to attracting talent and navigating a rapidly evolving landscape.\nVerci is a workspace and social space in NYC and LA, meticulously curated for founders, artists, and creatives. Learn more at verci.com and read our manifesto at verci.com/manifesto.",
